sequenceDiagram
    participant Host as Host Browser
    participant Traefik as Traefik Ingress
    participant OAuth2 as oauth2-proxy
    participant Dex as Dex OIDC
    participant Service as Protected Service

    Host->>Traefik: GET https://streamlit.taxi.localhost:8443
    Traefik->>OAuth2: ForwardAuth check
    OAuth2-->>Traefik: 401 (no session)
    Traefik->>Host: 302 Redirect to /oauth2/start

    Host->>OAuth2: GET /oauth2/start
    OAuth2->>Host: 302 Redirect to Dex /auth

    Host->>Dex: GET /auth?client_id=...&redirect_uri=...
    Dex->>Host: Login form / static password
    Host->>Dex: POST credentials

    Dex->>OAuth2: 302 redirect with auth code
    OAuth2->>Dex: POST /token (code exchange)
    Dex->>OAuth2: id_token + access_token + refresh_token

    OAuth2->>Host: Set session cookie, redirect to original URL
    Host->>Traefik: GET https://streamlit.taxi.localhost:8443
    Traefik->>OAuth2: ForwardAuth (with cookie)
    OAuth2->>Dex: Validate session / userinfo
    Dex->>OAuth2: User info + groups claim
    OAuth2->>Traefik: 202 Accepted + X-Forwarded-User headers

    Traefik->>Service: Proxy request + identity headers
    Service->>Traefik: Response
    Traefik->>Host: Response
